# Pairs with BulkHintBound. Issue #5752: the appended leaf's read position is the
# stored hint uncapped, as production applied it before ShardRootGrain.CapAtReadFrontier.
# A foreign record of the range the old leaf had not replayed when it narrowed lies
# below the hint: the old leaf never holds it, so the narrow hands nothing back, and
# the appended leaf is born above it.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundForeignUnheldBeforeNarrow
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the birth hint is applied uncapped by the old leaf's read frontier at the narrow
PERTURBS: Finish

--- FIND
    /\ rpN' = IF relocOk /\ hint # Null THEN Min2(hint - 1, fO) ELSE rpN
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no cap at the old leaf's read frontier.
    /\ rpN' = IF relocOk /\ hint # Null THEN hint - 1 ELSE rpN
--- END